calamares-settings-raye (0.1~dev5) resolute; urgency=medium

  * TPM unlock works on chips with only the SHA-256 bank, which is most
    of them.
  * Wi-Fi page and side bar in the Raye night colours.
  * About shows Raye first; the installer's licence sits behind a link.
  * No automatic login when the TPM opens the disk: a stolen laptop
    would otherwise start on its owner's desktop.

